//? Title: Strassen multiplication: actual seven products, crossover and padding
//? Subtitle: Actual canonical histories, retained original fixtures and explicit controls
//? Exports: both
//? Lang: en-GB

\abstract(
Strassen trades one of eight half-size matrix products for extra additions. The
native producer exposes actual returned blocks and counts, including the
schoolbook crossover and rectangular padding costs.
)

\toc

> Mechanism and mathematical scope

For square blocks, M1=(A11+A22)(B11+B22), M2=(A21+A22)B11, M3=A11(B12-B22),
M4=A22(B21-B11), M5=(A11+A12)B22, M6=(A21-A11)(B11+B12), M7=(A12-A22)(B21+B22).
Combine C11=M1+M4-M5+M7, C12=M3+M5, C21=M2+M4, C22=M1-M2+M3+M6. There are
eighteen half-block scalar addition/subtraction arrays per internal call.
Fixed-crossover arithmetic is O(s^log2(7)) for padded order s. Floating
cancellation and substantial temporary storage remain; operation counts do not
establish a speedup.

> A tiny actual producing history

The table and native concept diagram read the same producing execution. Every
block below is a complete editable C++ program.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/strassen_tiny.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
#include <filesystem>
#include <print>
#include <algorithm>
#include <cmath>
#include <limits>
#include <numeric>
#include <numbers>
#include <random>
#include <string>
#include <vector>
#include <map>
#include <set>
#include <array>
#include <tuple>
#include <bit>
#include <datamunge/random/quality.hpp>
#include <datamunge/algorithms/strassen.hpp>
int main() {
    namespace a = dm::algorithms;
    namespace g = dm::graphics;
    std::filesystem::create_directories("build");
    a::StrassenOptions o;
    o.leaf_size = 1;
    auto r = a::strassen_trace({{1, 2}, {3, 4}}, {{5, 6}, {7, 8}}, o);
    std::print("| actual postorder path | depth | returned block | cumulative products | block sums |\n| " "--- | ---: | --- | ---: | ---: |\n");
    for (const auto &s : r.steps)
        std::print("| {} | {} | `{}` | {} | {} |\n", s.path, s.depth, s.result,
                   s.scalar_products, s.block_additions);
    g::Diagram concept_diagram(48, 1100);
    concept_diagram.node("n0", {0, 0}, "2x2 input; explicit leaf size1");
    concept_diagram.node("n1", {5, 0},
                         std::format("{} actual leaf products",
                                     r.scalar_products));
    concept_diagram.node("n2", {10, 0},
                         std::format("{} actual block sums", r.block_additions));
    concept_diagram.edge("n0", "n1").edge("n1", "n2");
    concept_diagram.save_svg("build/strassen_tiny.svg");
}
```
