> API and interpretation

Finite rectangular inputs are fully validated. The checked run rejects
incompatible dimensions; the compatibility wrapper returns empty for finite
well-shaped incompatible inputs. Default2x2 does eight products; explicit
leaf_size1 demonstrates seven. Original100x100 pads to128 and executes1,835,008
scalar products, exceeding the1,000,000 unpadded schoolbook products. The4096
curves are labelled analytic references and are not reported as measured
execution.

Reusable producers, fixtures and histories live in the canonical C++ library.
Captured records own their values and do not come from a separate report replay.
Selected counters and record/scalar policies are specified at their API
boundaries; they are not peak-byte or wall-time budgets. Synthetic structural
inputs are controlled fixtures for these mechanisms.

